        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-3" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse stakeholder requirements&lt;br&gt;- Define and agree the service financial management approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Communicate and integrate the service financial management approach into the organization&#39;s value streams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review and adjust the service financial management approach and processes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service financial management practice is to support the organization&#39;s strategies and plans for service management by ensuring that the organization&#39;s financial resources and investments are being used effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow the organization&#39;s approach to service financial management, in order to for it to be performed in a homogenous manner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Service financial management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-4" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Service financial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;management (3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Financial planning" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5430.5" y="2260" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="2260" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-5" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse the previous and current plans and performance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Estimate costs and income&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Compile the budgets&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Communicate and agree the budgets&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Monitor and control costs and income&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review and report on the budget&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service financial management practice is to support the organization&#39;s strategies and plans for service management by ensuring that the organization&#39;s financial resources and investments are being used effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to estimate costs, compile budgets, agree budget as well as monitor and review it, in order to assure that financial resources are managed economically.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Service financial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;management (3.2.3)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-7" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Service financial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;management (3.2.3)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Management accounting" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6550.5" y="7280" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="2270" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-8" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Identify and capture costs&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Select a cost allocation model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Follow the cost allocation model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Manage exceptions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Provide standard and tailored reports&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service financial management practice is to support the organization&#39;s strategies and plans for service management by ensuring that the organization&#39;s financial resources and investments are being used effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to allocate and report costs correctly, in order to assure cost transparency.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
