        <mxCell id="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Service availability analysis&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Reporting service availability&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Planning and designing service availability&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the availability management practice is to ensure that services deliver the agreed levels of availability to meet the needs of the customers and users.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to analyze the solutions availability and adapt availability settings respectively, in order to maintain an adequate level of availability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-3" vertex="1">
