        <mxCell id="jNRMRp2S-dL0ja43aLe--12" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Plan audit&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Collect IT asset data&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Verify IT asset data&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review and analyse verification and audit outputs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Compose and communicate verification and audit reports&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service financial management practice is to support the organization&#39;s strategies and plans for service management by ensuring that the organization&#39;s financial resources and investments are being used effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects contribute to conducted audits and verifications or conduct them by themselves, in order to verify the registered IT assets and maintain an adequate quality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="jNRMRp2S-dL0ja43aLe--11" vertex="1">
